00:13:24,616 --> 00:13:30,163
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">high school now, a neighborhood
kid is just a neighborhood kid.</font>

165
00:13:31,498 --> 00:13:32,415
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh?</font>

166
00:13:33,875 --> 00:13:36,753
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Chii. Alright it's your turn to say it.</font>

167
00:13:39,548 --> 00:13:40,465
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Just do it.</font>

168
00:13:41,633 --> 00:13:43,510
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Do you know why I always
call you "Chii" as a nickname?</font>

169
00:13:43,593 --> 00:13:45,470
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No clue.</font>

170
00:13:46,513 --> 00:13:47,764
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sound it out.</font>

171
00:13:47,848 --> 00:13:49,140
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Chii...</font>

172
00:13:49,224 --> 00:13:50,433
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Enunciate!</font>

173
00:13:50,517 --> 00:13:52,894
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Chii.</font>

174
00:13:54,855 --> 00:13:57,148
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's it.</font>

175
00:14:04,447 --> 00:14:05,574
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">There's a smile!</font>

176
00:14:10,328 --> 00:14:13,290
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Toru!
- Chii!</font>

177
00:14:14,499 --> 00:14:15,417
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Chii! Chii.</font>

178
00:14:29,431 --> 00:14:32,225
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Toru... I like you.</font>

179
00:14:48,825 --> 00:14:51,786
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And I like you too.</font>

180
00:14:58,710 --> 00:15:00,587
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I knew you'd say that.</font>

181
00:15:01,796 --> 00:15:05,175
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's not the way I meant it though.</font>

182
00:15:05,258 --> 00:15:06,927
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But... I'm happy.</font>

183
00:15:09,930 --> 00:15:11,389
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I was... wondering...</font>

184
00:15:12,933 --> 00:15:18,104
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm not your real little sister, just a
kid from the neighborhood. but the next</font>

185
00:15:18,188 --> 00:15:23,360
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">time you're here to visit, I was
wondering... can I still come and see you?</font>

186
00:15:23,443 --> 00:15:28,573
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Don't be dumb. Stop
acting like a stranger!</font>

187
00:15:31,660 --> 00:15:35,872
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">To me, you are my little sister. And you
might be cuter than Ryu. But don't tell</font>

188
00:15:35,956 --> 00:15:40,168
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">him that, okay?</font>

189
00:15:41,211 --> 00:15:43,672
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Little sister, huh?</font>

190
00:15:45,173 --> 00:15:51,763
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'll bet when he's with his fiancé, he
shows her all the different sides he has...</font>

191
00:15:51,846 --> 00:15:53,723
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But I'm still happy.</font>

192
00:15:54,683 --> 00:15:58,395
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I can tell... that you've
always cared about me...</font>

193
00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:03,066
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Even if it's as a big brother.</font>

194
00:16:09,906 --> 00:16:10,824
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Chii!</font>

195
00:16:17,455 --> 00:16:18,999
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Toru! Congrats, kay?</font>

196
00:16:30,802 --> 00:16:32,846
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, you went out for a jog?</font>

197
00:16:33,888 --> 00:16:36,725
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Where's Chizuru?
- Home. I walked her there</font>

198
00:16:36,808 --> 00:16:39,602
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}- myself so no need to worry.
- Heading back?</font>

199
00:16:39,686 --> 00:16:41,896
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yep. I'll visit again soon.</font>

200
00:16:41,980 --> 00:16:43,606
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}Wait here for a second.</font>

201
00:16:45,442 --> 00:16:46,943
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Here, the bread.</font>

202
00:16:47,027 --> 00:16:50,739
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You're a reliable guy
Ryu. When are they from?</font>

203
00:16:50,822 --> 00:16:53,074
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh... yesterday... wait.</font>

204
00:16:54,034 --> 00:16:59,205
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Should be okay though. It's winter.
- Thank you.</font>

205
00:16:59,289 --> 00:17:03,251
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Whoa! You've gotten big too, haven't
you! I bet you're gonna be taller than me.</font>

206
00:17:03,334 --> 00:17:07,338
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yep, I will, I'm
still in my growth spurt.</font>

207
00:17:10,133 --> 00:17:14,763
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You and Chii are a lot alike
Not at all the flexible type.</font>

208
00:17:15,597 --> 00:17:20,518
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Good luck. You're a much better
match for her than I would be.</font>

209
00:17:21,061 --> 00:17:22,312
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Bro...</font>

210
00:17:22,395 --> 00:17:23,313
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Bro?!</font>

211
00:17:24,314 --> 00:17:26,816
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I was thinking the exact same thing.</font>

212
00:17:32,822 --> 00:17:34,657
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">He's a man all right.</font>

213
00:17:38,078 --> 00:17:41,081
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, Hi, Ryu, Chizu wasn't out with you?</font>

214
00:17:42,665 --> 00:17:43,583
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No.</font>

215
00:17:44,125 --> 00:17:47,045
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She's so late. I thought she'd be at your
place like usual. Goodness. what is that</font>

216
00:17:47,128 --> 00:17:50,799
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">child of mine up to now?</font>

217
00:17:51,549 --> 00:17:54,511
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I think I might know
where she is. I'll go check.</font>

218
00:17:54,594 --> 00:17:57,847
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, thank you for that, honey.</font>

219
00:17:57,931 --> 00:18:01,935
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Doesn't act it but even so,
she is still a girl, ya know...</font>

220
00:18:19,160 --> 00:18:22,122
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Do you want me to comfort you?</font>

221
00:18:24,040 --> 00:18:27,418
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Are you... trying to be sensitive
about my feelings? Or pick a fight?</font>

222
00:18:27,502 --> 00:18:31,131
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Neither of those things.</font>

223
00:18:31,214 --> 00:18:34,843
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What the heck?! What are
you doing out here then?</font>

224
00:18:35,385 --> 00:18:40,974
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Because back when my brother was still
living at the house. this was the last</font>

225
00:18:41,057 --> 00:18:46,646
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">place he went to hang out. And it's also
where you were that day when he left here.</font>

226
00:18:48,898 --> 00:18:51,776
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Didn't I tell you that I didn't want
you to talk to me for a little while?</font>

227
00:18:51,860 --> 00:18:54,737
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Fine. I won't talk then.</font>

228
00:19:01,911 --> 00:19:05,498
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I didn't mean it. Sorry.</font>

229
00:19:09,002 --> 00:19:12,922
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And that one day was
your birthday too. Sorry.</font>

230
00:19:14,090 --> 00:19:17,510
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Especially since the only one who
could've properly celebrated it with you</font>

231
00:19:17,594 --> 00:19:21,055
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">this year... was me. I'm sorry.</font>

232
00:19:21,639 --> 00:19:28,021
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Nah, I mean, I don't think anyone
remembered... well, except for you, I guess.</font>

233
00:19:28,104 --> 00:19:29,772
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thank you for the bag.</font>

234
00:19:33,359 --> 00:19:35,862
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It was you, huh? That called Toru.</font>

235
00:19:37,155 --> 00:19:41,409
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">'Cause when I asked Toru if he was
hungry, he said, "Ryu's giving me some</font>

236
00:19:41,492 --> 00:19:45,705
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">bread." Well, it's not
like I'm shocked or anything.</font>

237
00:19:45,788 --> 00:19:49,959
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Even though you asked him to, it doesn't
change the fact he drove three and a half</font>

238
00:19:50,043 --> 00:19:54,255
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">hours to come here. It
made me happy. So, thank you.</font>

239
00:19:59,844 --> 00:20:02,222
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's exactly like you said before.</font>

240
00:20:03,056 --> 00:20:08,186
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You knew I always liked Toru
even though I didn't stand a chance...</font>

241
00:20:08,269 --> 00:20:13,524
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I guess, I never actually believed
that he could feel the same about me.</font>

242
00:20:13,608 --> 00:20:16,694
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Maybe the entire time, I just looked
up to Toru as more of a big brother.</font>

243
00:20:16,778 --> 00:20:19,864
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's not it.</font>

244
00:20:24,118 --> 00:20:28,122
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">'Cause you really did love
him. And I always knew that.</font>

245
00:20:43,721 --> 00:20:48,393
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Please comfort me, Ryu...</font>

246
00:21:09,622 --> 00:21:13,543
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">On that day... we had our
first snowfall of the year.</font>

247
00:22:27,158 --> 00:22:28,576
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The holy night.</font>

248
00:22:29,285 --> 00:22:31,454
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">A silently growing desire.</font>

249
00:22:32,997 --> 00:22:35,041
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Next time: "Christmas"</font>
